VALUES ('089d78ce-eeed-5bac-8261-6f01612124bd', 'b7de515a-106c-536d-a72d-1b4b96fdb08d', '4ebb2e6d-f47c-5971-96df-8ad3e65472bc', '0fc61953-63ba-5633-bca8-4849a4489f8e', 'Organization Type', 'The top-level body, such as a group or corporation. A legal company. A business division with its own results. A major part of the organisation. A functional unit. A local office or branch. A company controlled by another. Any other organised body. Classifies the organizational structure represented by the specialization. Used for hierarchy, authorization, reporting, transaction scope, and organizational configuration. Organization type describes structure, not commercial role. Customer/Supplier behavior belongs to PartyRole specializations. Controls applicable organizational hierarchy and operating-context rules. Required — the record cannot be saved while this is empty.', 50, 50, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, 'U', TRUE, 'system', 'system', NOW(), NOW())
